<title>USA: Donnkenny declines comment on chairman.</title>
<headline>Donnkenny declines comment on chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnkenny Inc executives on Monday declined comment on newspaper reports that the company's board would convene a special meeting on Tuesday to review the position of Richard Rubin, its chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>The story was first reported in the Wall Street Journal on Monday.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
